{
  "about": "One FLIGHTDECK_SERVER value for the Python sensor, the Claude Code plugin and the playground. Each value is an http(s) URL as a user may set it; ingest and api are the ingestion URL and the API URL it names. A path whose last segment is ingest (trailing slashes aside) is the ingestion URL and the API is the same path with that segment replaced by api; any other path is the server's base URL and gets /ingest and /api appended. Surrounding whitespace, credentials, the query, the fragment, trailing slashes and the scheme's default port go; the scheme and the host are lower-cased. The sensor (_resolve_server_urls), the plugin (serverBaseUrl) and the playground (_helpers.server_urls) each assert every row.",
